{"4984780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Who Stole It !", "steam_appid": 4984780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984780/extras/4756ce05a268a8fba2e7a5861c3b8b01.avif?t=1786841415\" width=1280 height=852 /></span><strong>The lights are off. The van is waiting. Who stole it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who Stole It! is a cartoon cops-and-robbers party game. Thieves sneak through a museum at night, grabbing paintings, gems and gold and smuggling them out to the getaway van. The police hunt them down — and in this game nobody dies. You get ARRESTED, locked in a cell, and your friends have to break you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two ways to play every night</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thief</strong> — watch the patrol, wait for your moment, grab, run, deliver. Then get greedy for one more painting… and get caught red-handed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police</strong> — patrol the halls, watch the CCTV monitors, cut the power to set traps, and march every last thief into a prison cell.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 characters, each with their own tricks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Clown drops fake copies of himself — arrest the wrong one and the fine comes out of YOUR pocket.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ghost Kid kills the lights and summons a crowd of ghosts to guard him.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Timekeeper picks the prison lock and frees the whole cell.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wanderer has no powers at all. Pure skill, pure nerve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…plus sneaky scouts, dapper counts and hard-nosed officers to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools of the trade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smoke bombs. Decoys. Power cuts that plunge the museum into darkness. Fires that cost the city money if the police ignore them. Security cameras, vents, and one very tempting getaway van.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never wait in an empty lobby</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo against AI thieves, or host for friends — bots fill every empty seat in the crew and hand their spot to real players who join. Two players are enough to start the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetric multiplayer — thieves vs police.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable characters with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrests instead of deaths: jail time, sentences, prison breaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional chaos rule: caught thieves join the police.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player vs bots, online with bot backfill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat, text chat, mute and kick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menus in 16 languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984780/extras/4756ce05a268a8fba2e7a5861c3b8b01.avif?t=1786841415\" width=1280 height=852 /></span><strong>The lights are off. The van is waiting. Who stole it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who Stole It! is a cartoon cops-and-robbers party game. Thieves sneak through a museum at night, grabbing paintings, gems and gold and smuggling them out to the getaway van. The police hunt them down — and in this game nobody dies. You get ARRESTED, locked in a cell, and your friends have to break you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two ways to play every night</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thief</strong> — watch the patrol, wait for your moment, grab, run, deliver. Then get greedy for one more painting… and get caught red-handed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police</strong> — patrol the halls, watch the CCTV monitors, cut the power to set traps, and march every last thief into a prison cell.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 characters, each with their own tricks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Clown drops fake copies of himself — arrest the wrong one and the fine comes out of YOUR pocket.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ghost Kid kills the lights and summons a crowd of ghosts to guard him.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Timekeeper picks the prison lock and frees the whole cell.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wanderer has no powers at all. Pure skill, pure nerve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…plus sneaky scouts, dapper counts and hard-nosed officers to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools of the trade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smoke bombs. Decoys. Power cuts that plunge the museum into darkness. Fires that cost the city money if the police ignore them. Security cameras, vents, and one very tempting getaway van.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never wait in an empty lobby</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo against AI thieves, or host for friends — bots fill every empty seat in the crew and hand their spot to real players who join. Two players are enough to start the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetric multiplayer — thieves vs police.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable characters with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrests instead of deaths: jail time, sentences, prison breaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional chaos rule: caught thieves join the police.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player vs bots, online with bot backfill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat, text chat, mute and kick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menus in 16 languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Cartoon cops vs robbers. Sneak into the museum, stuff your bag with paintings and gold, and get it to the van — or play police and throw the whole crew in jail. 10 characters with wild tricks: clown decoys, ghost armies, prison breaks. Friends or AI bots — the heist is always on.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hindi<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984780/2a42083ef78ed456b26731dc4befbf0cc811d3fd/header.jpg?t=1786841415", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984780/62ea06f751d60328a145a168d4e49ba3563f94b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786841415", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984780/62ea06f751d60328a145a168d4e49ba3563f94b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786841415", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "